{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：11:56 2026-11-12 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"警員檢查貓屍。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl_square/9970320b70d35214b5ad2fca05ab976e/2026-11/page_111.jpg\"/>\n<p>今日（12日）早上10時07分，警方接獲報案，指慈雲山道休憩公園內有貓隻屍體。人員到場後，在公園一處地上發現一個粉紅色環保袋，袋內有一隻再被膠袋包裹的花貓屍體。</p>\n<p>現場消息稱，死去的是一隻成年花貓，其身上並無明顯可疑傷痕。警方不排除牠因老死或病死，被人棄置在公園內，稍後交由愛護動物協會跟進，確定貓隻的死因。</p>\n<img alt=\"警方檢查花貓屍體。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6504789a56b5bd98424981deef67364a/2026-11/4_12.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"花貓屍體被膠袋包裹，再放入環保袋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/af515d51b1e09cb8fff968f46ea46480/2026-11/3_0_14.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"花貓屍體被膠袋包裹，再放入粉紅色環保袋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a6e1ea0ff709a9095e40062bf253bb4f/2026-11/2_12.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3575c8805515f8d95e20faff90685429/2026-11/1_1_19.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3e82118bdbc74e16050547a635f830a1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_11_15_59.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/77c65aa65e70af57c8538776eb978db3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_11_16_05.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/320bf0dbd80a846a957f85ae32740ce4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_11_16_04.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/665aa746b1b2df984cfdab007d4fc0e9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_11_16_03_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場是慈雲山道休憩公園。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5ed767a00392c9de3bc50fa783bec805/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_11_16_03.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c4e93ecaaf060b62e748eca64e82255c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_11_16_02_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3fd8a31704ac32ac1e42a436ebbaa4dc/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_11_16_02.jpeg\"/>\n<p>愛協表示，今早愛協接獲警方轉介一宗動物屍體發現案，指在慈雲山道休憩公園內發現一具貓屍在一個塑膠袋內。督察到場替貓隻進行初步檢查，據警方表示貓屍原先由毛巾包裹好，並置於塑膠袋內。該貓屍為一隻老年雌性本地短毛貓，沒有晶片。身上並無任何傷口或傷痕，毛色乾淨整潔，趾甲有被修剪痕跡。警方亦在現場調查，暫未發現涉及殘酷對待動物，列暫作動物屍體發現，貓屍轉介食環署處理。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:43:58.035196+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T03:56:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T08:57:30.749677+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:37:36.047486+00:00","content_hash":"97fdcf9cda47ca770bdb4bd7e8240390e7ea9b2bc9cf9c25d9ec2702501cf759","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}